   "text": "As we discussed before, this created an impetus for the entire village to get educated because they could see that if they are able to get education till about class tenth or class twelfth, then there was a job opportunity available. In our education model, we had discussed this quite a bit, that one of the challenges of education, especially for poor parents, is that they are not sure. In our education module, we discussed that it was a challenge for the poor parents to think what kind of returns they would get from the investment that they make for their children's education. But if"
